Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 18:03:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] applets/taskmanager: let other widgets pin launchers to
 activities

The Application Launcher can only pin an app to the task manager on all
activities, as the task manager only exposes a call to add a launcher
everywhere. Expose its launcher activities and calls to add or remove one.

BUG: 525899
---
 applets/taskmanager/qml/main.qml | 16 ++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 16 insertions(+)

diff --git a/applets/taskmanager/qml/main.qml b/applets/taskmanager/qml/main.qml
