From cb3be1cbfcb83a166fb98c12d764ebf6fb186ce5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Niccol=C3=B2=20Venerandi?= <niccolo@venerandi.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 18:03:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] applets/kicker: allow pinning apps to the task manager per
 activity

With more than one activity, "Pin to Task Manager" always pinned the app
on every activity and disappeared once it was pinned anywhere. It is now
a submenu like the task manager's own, to pin or unpin it per activity.

BUG: 525899
